+ray-traced lighting, NVIDIA DLSS/DLAA and AMD FSR 3.1 upscaling, NVIDIA NRD
+denoising, HDR output, optional 3D sound (Steam Audio) and a local chat
+translation service. This is not an official Sauerbraten release.
